  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy study Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed market study will map the renewable energy sector, with a focus on the productive use of energy in Kenya, its key public-private actors and linkages to the Netherlands, trends, issues, challenges and (business) opportunities.The study will be done in the context of the Netherlands&apos; effort to support Kenya&apos;s energy transition and private sector development, as well as to increase trade and investment in a sustainable and responsible manner.This study will provide a full, reliable and up-to-date overview of opportunities for commercial delivery of Dutch expertise and technology, as well as investment opportunities for the sustainable development of the renewable energy sector.These will be linked to the Netherlands embassy&apos;s combi-tracks &quot;Cold chain agri-logistics&quot; and &quot;Health&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
